# Line-ending normalization (from the VS Code "Publish to GitHub" repo init)
* text=auto

# LFS patterns inherited from the DisasterM3 dataset download -- harmless to keep even
# though the raw dataset itself is gitignored; these still apply if anyone re-adds
# large binary artifacts of these types later.
